    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "When a player breaks msm_starter:lucky_block, one thing happens, picked at random by weight: it drops prizes rolled from msm_starter:lucky_block/prizes (weight 6), or brings a zombie (weight 3), or makes an explosion that breaks no blocks (weight 1), or places the building msm_starter:lucky_block/surprise_hut (weight 3), or gives speed for 30 seconds (weight 3). On export the book becomes the block's break event and a generated script, so it needs the Fabric mod jar export."
